          end: Duration(milliseconds: 46296),
          text:
              'Beneath the symbol were the words they had discovered the previous night:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 46296),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 52416),
          text:
              'He would be made from the earth... but what Allah would teach him would surprise the heavens.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52416),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 58536),
          text:
              'Dadi began by telling them that Allah created Adam, the first human being, from the earth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59227),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 62544),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at his own hands with new interest.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 62544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 66544),
          text: '"So Adam wasn\'t made from gold or something valuable?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 66544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 68544),
          text: '"No," Dadi replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 68544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 70544),
          text: '"He was made from the earth."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 70544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72544),
          text: 'That puzzled him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76544),
          text: 'If the material itself was humble, what made Adam special?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77144),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 83792),
          text:
              'Dadi explained that this was precisely one of the beautiful lessons of Adam\'s creation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 83792),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 88392),
          text:
              'Human dignity did not come from being made of expensive material.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 88392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95312),
          text:
              'Allah had given human beings remarkable abilities and, with those abilities, responsibility.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95312),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 98192),
          text: 'A bird could fly more naturally than a human.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98480),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 100860),
          text: 'A horse could run faster.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 102660),
          text: 'Many animals were stronger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 102660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108460),
          text:
              'Yet Allah had given Adam knowledge, understanding and the ability to learn.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108460),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110700),
          text: 'Then came a remarkable moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110700),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 113740),
          text: 'Allah taught Adam the names of things.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113740),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 120728),
          text:
              'The children listened closely as Dadi explained how Adam was given knowledge that Allah had chosen to teach him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 120728),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 130888),
          text:
              'When this knowledge was demonstrated before the angels, they recognised that knowledge belonged ultimately to Allah and that they knew only what Allah had taught them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131246),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 135728),
          text:
              'Imaan began to understand the meaning of the mysterious sentence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135728),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140124),
          text:
              '"So Adam\'s honour wasn\'t about being stronger than every creature."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140124),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140325),
          text: '"No."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140325),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141632),
          text: '"Or being richer."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141632),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141833),
          text: '"No."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141833),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146256),
          text: '"It was connected with knowledge and responsibility."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 146832),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 147523),
          text: 'Dadi nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148214),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150403),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked around the room.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150403),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 155783),
          text:
              'A lamp, a clock, a bookshelf, pens, cups - everything had a name.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 155783),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160384),
          text: 'He imagined the first human learning from Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 167384),
          text:
              'Dadi reminded them that even today every child arrives in this world knowing almost nothing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 167384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 177384),
          text:
              'A baby must learn words, faces, manners, skills, numbers, rules and eventually the difference between right and wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 177384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180152),
          text: 'Mama smiled from across the room.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180152),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184592),
          text:
              '"You even had to learn that crayons are for drawing, not eating."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185298),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186592),
          text: 'Akhlaq stared at her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 186592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 188632),
          text: '"I was conducting research."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 188632),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190512),
          text: 'Everyone laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191092),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191962),
          text: 'Dadi continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191962),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196752),
          text: 'Knowledge, she explained, should not make a person arrogant.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196752),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204020),
          text:
              'If Allah gives someone the ability to understand something quickly, that knowledge should make them useful to others.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204020),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 211520),
          text:
              'If a child understands mathematics and another struggles, knowledge should encourage help rather than mockery.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 211520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215920),
          text:
              'If someone reads well, they can support someone who is still learning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215920),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 221968),
          text:
              'If someone is talented in sport, that talent can be used to teach rather than humiliate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222222),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226128),
          text:
              '"Then knowledge is almost like a responsibility," Akhlaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226128),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 228288),
          text: '"Yes," Dadi replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 228288),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232128),
          text:
              '"A gift becomes more beautiful when it benefits someone besides you."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232848),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236288),
          text:
              'Then she reached the part of the story the children had been waiting for.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237297),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 241376),
          text: 'Allah commanded the angels to prostrate before Adam.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241889),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247836),
          text:
              'Dadi carefully explained that this was not worship of Adam; worship belongs only to Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248256),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253936),
          text:
              'It was an act performed because Allah commanded it and an honour given to Adam.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253936),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255816),
          text: 'The angels obeyed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 256816),
          text: 'All of them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 257436),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260944),
          text: 'Akhlaq smiled, but then noticed that Dadi had stopped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 260944),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262304),
          text: '"All of them?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262800),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264784),
          text: 'Dadi looked toward the wooden box.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264784),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265984),
          text: '"Almost."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266393),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 268544),
          text: 'Imaan immediately understood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270524),
          text: '"Iblees."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270524),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271264),
          text: 'Dadi nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271797),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 272864),
          text: 'Iblees stood there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 272864),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 275624),
          text: 'He had witnessed the honour given to Adam.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275624),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277624),
          text: 'He had heard the command.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277624),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279106),
          text: 'Yet he did not obey.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281392),
          text: 'Not because he misunderstood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 281392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283494),
          text: 'Not because he had not heard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286992),
          text: 'Something had begun to grow inside him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286992),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287992),
          text: 'Pride.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288340),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 292778),
          text:
              'Imaan turned Envelope Two over and discovered another folded slip.',
