        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 296592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 298112),
          text: 'I AM BETTER.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299233),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301560),
          text: 'Akhlaq read them twice.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301560),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304880),
          text: '"That doesn\'t sound very dangerous."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305337),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 307440),
          text: 'Dadi looked at him thoughtfully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 307440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 313100),
          text:
              '"Sometimes the most dangerous ideas begin with very simple words."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 313100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315800),
          text: 'She reached for the third envelope.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315800),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 318000),
          text: 'Its symbol was a crown.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 318128),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 320137),
          text: 'Underneath were the words:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 320137),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 325648),
          text:
              'He was given a command... but pride made him argue with his Creator.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 326488),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 328648),
          text: 'Akhlaq\'s expression changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 328648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 330328),
          text: '"He argued with Allah?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333848),
          text: 'Dadi returned the envelope to the box.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 333848),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 336688),
          text: '"Tomorrow you will hear what he said."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 336688),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337808),
          text: 'The box closed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 338096),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 345096),
          text:
              'And that night, the children left with a question that seemed much bigger than the three words written on the card:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 345096),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353096),
          text:
              'What happens when believing yourself superior becomes more important than obeying what is right?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 358096),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Use What You Know to Help',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 359064),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 365804),
          text:
              'Today, use one thing you are good at to help someone who finds it difficult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 365804),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 370864),
          text:
              'Teach without showing off and without making the other person feel small.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 370864),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 376664),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Help someone learn the skill without taking over the task.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 376664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 380032),
          text: 'Let them try it themselves.',
        ),
      ],
