          text: 'He would try to mislead the children of Adam.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150800),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156820),
          text:
              'Human beings would spread across the earth, and Iblees wanted to tempt them away from the straight path.',
