          text: 'Just this once.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 202764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205636),
          text: 'And perhaps the oldest one of all:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 205636),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 207764),
          text: 'You are better than them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 208293),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213764),
          text:
              'Akhlaq\'s confidence from the science quiz suddenly looked less impressive to him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213764),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 221932),
          text:
              'He remembered Bilal, who had missed several days of school and asked him for help with one of the science questions.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 221932),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 223754),
          text: '"What did you tell him?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224183),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225148),
          text: 'Dadi asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 227292),
          text: 'Akhlaq lowered his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227292),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229356),
          text: '"I told him it was easy."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 229356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231056),
          text: '"And did that help?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231056),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231299),
          text: '"No."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231299),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234092),
          text: 'The realisation was enough.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240840),
          text:
              'Akhlaq decided that the next day he would sit beside Bilal and explain the question properly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240840),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244340),
          text: 'Dadi did not praise him excessively.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 244340),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246440),
          text: 'She simply smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246440),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249880),
          text: 'That was precisely the point of the story.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 249880),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 258052),
          text:
              'Strength and knowledge could be used either to stand above someone - or to reach down and help them rise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 258052),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262668),
          text: 'Before closing the box, Dadi showed them the fourth envelope.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262668),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263543),
          text: 'A tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263543),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 267220),
          text: 'Beneath it were the words:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267220),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 268971),
          text: 'One command.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268971),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270197),
          text: 'One tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270197),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271948),
          text: 'One whisper.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276057),
          text: 'Then Imaan noticed another sentence:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 276057),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281956),
          text:
              'The easiest trap is sometimes the one that sounds like friendly advice.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282783),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 284556),
          text: 'Akhlaq stared at the tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284556),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286716),
          text: 'Adam knew Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286716),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287728),
          text: 'He had been honoured.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290852),
          text: 'He had been warned about Iblees.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291436),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 296276),
          text:
              'How could Iblees possibly convince him to make the wrong choice?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 296276),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297444),
          text: 'The box closed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 297444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 300804),
          text: 'Tomorrow, they would find out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 300804),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 306082),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Lower the Crown',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 306082),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 317392),
          text:
              'Find one moment today when you could put yourself first and deliberately choose respect instead.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 317392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 323132),
          text:
              'Give someone a turn, congratulate someone who outperforms you, listen without interrupting, include someone overlooked, or apologise first when you know you were wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 323132),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 330722),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Choose one person you often compare yourself with and do one sincere good act for that person.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
