      title: 'Ep 4 · The Forbidden Tree',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/adam.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/adam/04_the_forbidden_tree.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.prophets,
      description: 'Hazrat Adam (A.S.) — episode 4 of 6.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1729),
          text: 'EPISODE 4',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1729),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3729),
          text: 'The Forbidden Tree',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3729),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 5809),
          text: 'The whisper that sounded like advice',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 5817),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 11817),
          text:
              'One afternoon, Imaan found Akhlaq staring suspiciously at Mama\'s tablet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 11817),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 18817),
          text:
              'A bright message on the screen promised thousands of free game coins if he clicked a large flashing button.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 18817),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 21421),
          text: '"Hamza sent it," Akhlaq explained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 21421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 23817),
          text: '"He says everyone is using it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 24262),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 25785),
          text: 'Imaan looked doubtful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 25785),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30505),
          text:
              'Mama had clearly told them not to download anything without permission.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 30505),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33545),
          text: 'The message, however, sounded reassuring.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 33545),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 35625),
          text: 'It promised rewards.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 35625),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37785),
          text: 'It claimed to be safe.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37785),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 42505),
          text:
              'It even sounded as though Akhlaq would be foolish not to press the button.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 43372),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47433),
          text:
              'Dadi Jaan entered at exactly that moment carrying the wooden box.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47433),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54193),
          text:
              '"That," she said, looking at the tablet, "is a very good introduction to tonight\'s story."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54193),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 57353),
          text: 'The fourth envelope showed the tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 57850),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 65393),
          text:
              'Dadi explained that after Adam had been created, Allah gave him companionship through Hawwa, the mother of humanity.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 65721),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 73721),
          text:
              'Adam and Hawwa lived in Paradise surrounded by blessings beyond anything children could fully imagine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 73721),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79561),
          text:
              'They were allowed to enjoy its blessings, but Allah gave them one clear restriction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79561),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 83721),
          text: 'There was one particular tree they were not to approach.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 84106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87661),
          text:
              'Akhlaq naturally wanted to know what kind of tree it had been.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87661),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94017),
          text:
              'Dadi explained simply that Allah had not made the type of tree important for their lesson.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 96173),
          text: 'What mattered was the command.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96604),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 98329),
          text: 'Imaan found that interesting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101056),
          text: 'They had so much available to them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101056),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105369),
          text:
              'Why become concerned about the one thing they had been told to avoid?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105657),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 109977),
          text: 'That was where Iblees entered the story again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109977),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 115537),
          text:
              'He did not approach them as an obvious enemy announcing his intention to cause harm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 115537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116857),
          text: 'He whispered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 121097),
          text: 'Gradually, he made the forbidden thing appear attractive.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 125097),
          text: 'He encouraged them to think about the tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125625),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 126586),
          text: 'Why this tree?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 126586),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 128159),
          text: 'What might it contain?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128159),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133051),
          text:
              'What if the restriction was keeping them from something wonderful?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133051),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 143190),
          text:
              'The more attention was placed upon the single restriction, the easier it became to forget the countless blessings already available.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 143190),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145145),
          text: 'Then Iblees went further.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145593),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148913),
          text: 'He made the wrong choice sound beneficial.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148913),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153473),
          text:
              'He presented himself as though he were sincerely advising them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153473),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 159273),
          text:
              'He suggested that eating from the tree could bring something desirable and lasting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 159895),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162473),
          text: 'Akhlaq suddenly looked toward the tablet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162473),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168961),
          text:
              'The flashing message did not say, Break your mother\'s rule and click something unsafe.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168961),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 172041),
          text: 'It said, Free coins.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 172041),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 173841),
          text: 'Everyone is doing it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 173841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175201),
          text: 'Click now.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175201),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180441),
          text:
              'The wrong choice looked completely different when wrapped in attractive words.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180441),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184241),
          text: 'Eventually, Adam and Hawwa ate from the tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184241),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 188136),
          text: 'The excitement disappeared almost immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 188136),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190649),
          text: 'They realised what they had done.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 192530),
          text: 'Akhlaq became quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192530),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195561),
          text: '"That\'s like some bad choices," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195561),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 198840),
          text: '"Before you do them, they seem exciting.',
