        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 198840),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 202049),
          text: 'Afterwards you wonder why you did it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 202537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203123),
          text: 'Dadi nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203123),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 211417),
          text:
              'Temptation often promises something before the action, but it does not remain to carry the consequences afterward.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 211795),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214537),
          text: 'Imaan asked something that troubled her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218457),
          text: '"If Adam was a Prophet, how could he make a mistake?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218839),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225017),
          text:
              'Dadi explained gently that goodness does not mean a person no longer needs Allah\'s guidance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 228065),
          text: 'Human beings need to remain alert.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 228065),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230625),
          text: 'Smart people can be deceived.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230625),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233265),
          text: 'Strong people can face weakness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233265),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 238385),
          text:
              'Someone who made a good decision yesterday can face another test today.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 238385),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 243865),
          text:
              'That meant children should be careful about saying, I would never do something like that.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243865),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246497),
          text: 'Pride itself could make people careless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246497),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 250525),
          text:
              'The children now desperately wanted to know what happened next.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 250525),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252369),
          text: 'Had everything been lost?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252369),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255581),
          text: 'Would Adam and Hawwa ever be forgiven?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256116),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 258578),
          text: 'Dadi removed the fifth envelope.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 258578),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 261898),
          text: 'A drop appeared to be falling toward the earth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261898),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263501),
          text: 'Beneath it was written:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263501),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265273),
          text: 'The mistake had been made.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 265401),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 267801),
          text: 'But one door was still open.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268235),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271601),
          text: 'Imaan immediately whispered, "Forgiveness."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 272120),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274301),
          text: 'Dadi smiled but closed the box.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274301),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276801),
          text: 'The answer would come tomorrow.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277589),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283601),
          text:
              'Akhlaq quietly picked up Mama\'s tablet, walked over to her and handed it back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283601),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287169),
          text: '"What about your free coins?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 287169),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 288362),
          text: 'Mama teased.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288362),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293489),
          text: '"I have decided to remain poor in imaginary currency."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293489),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 295231),
          text: 'Everyone laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 295231),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299529),
          text: 'But inside, Akhlaq understood something new.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299529),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305329),
          text:
              'Avoiding a wrong choice was easier when you learned to recognise the attractive wrapping around it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305337),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 309631),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Say No to One Wrong Choice',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 309631),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 316818),
          text:
              'Today, when someone invites you to do something you know is wrong, refuse calmly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 316818),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 329305),
          text:
              'Do not copy, tease, hide someone\'s belongings, lie for a friend, break a queue, open something without permission, or join harmful behaviour simply because others are doing it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 329305),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337131),
          text:
              'Level-Up: If a friend is being pressured into something wrong, stand beside them and make it easier for them to say no too.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
