          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262621),
          text: 'Death.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266249),
          text: 'Qabeel did not know what to do with his brother\'s body.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266249),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274889),
          text:
              'Allah sent a crow that scratched into the earth, and through what Qabeel witnessed, he learned how his brother\'s body could be covered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274889),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 280809),
          text:
              'The man who had thought himself powerful now found himself learning even from a bird.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280809),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282249),
          text: 'And he became regretful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283604),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286337),
          text: 'Akhlaq asked the question that mattered most.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286337),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 288217),
          text: '"Could it have been stopped?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288217),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290697),
          text: '"Yes," Dadi replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290697),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293417),
          text: '"Long before the final act."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293417),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297217),
          text:
              'It could have been stopped when disappointment first appeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 297217),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299457),
          text: 'When comparison began.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299457),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301457),
          text: 'When envy entered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301457),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 302657),
          text: 'When anger grew.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 303145),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305641),
          text: 'When the first threat was spoken.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305641),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 309245),
          text: 'There had been many opportunities to turn back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 309245),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312385),
          text: 'The murder did not begin with the final act.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312385),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 317245),
          text:
              'It began with a feeling that was allowed to grow without correction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 317245),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 321705),
          text: 'Just then Mama arrived with two slices of chocolate cake.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 321705),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 323113),
          text: 'One was noticeably larger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 323113),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324903),
          text: 'Both children saw it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 324903),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 327113),
          text: 'Both looked at each other.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 327678),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331791),
          text:
              'Akhlaq reached toward the larger slice, stopped, and pushed it toward Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 332113),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333078),
          text: '"You take it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 333506),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 338113),
          text: 'Imaan smiled and divided a little of it back onto his plate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 338762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 339951),
          text: 'Dadi watched them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 339951),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 342113),
          text: 'Small moments mattered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 343081),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348641),
          text:
              'Nobody imagined that an argument over cake was comparable to Qabeel\'s terrible crime.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348641),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 360441),
          text:
              'But the heart practised its habits in ordinary situations: sharing, congratulating others, controlling comparison and learning to be happy when someone else received something good.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 360441),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363049),
          text: 'Before the evening ended, Dadi gave them one final card:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 369049),
          text: 'If a bad feeling enters your heart, do not give it a home.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 369049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 373049),
          text: 'Feeling a moment of jealousy did not make a child evil.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 373049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 377049),
          text: 'The important question was what happened next.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 377049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 379049),
          text: 'Would they feed the feeling?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 382049),
          text: 'Would they complain about the other person?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 383017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 386017),
          text: 'Would they try to spoil their happiness?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 386017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 392017),
          text:
              'Or would they recognise the feeling, correct themselves and choose goodness?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 392017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 395017),
          text: 'The wooden box was finally empty.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 395017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 398017),
          text: 'Six envelopes had been opened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 398017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 402017),
          text: 'The flame had introduced the world before humanity.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 402985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 406345),
          text: 'The hand had revealed Adam and the gift of knowledge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 406345),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 409701),
          text: 'The crown had exposed the arrogance of Iblees.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 410225),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 415465),
          text:
              'The tree had shown how temptation could disguise itself as advice.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 415465),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 420745),
          text:
              'The falling drop had revealed repentance and the beginning of earthly life.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 420745),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 425909),
          text:
              'And the two stones had taught them what envy could become when left uncontrolled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 426416),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 430824),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked almost disappointed that the mystery had ended.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 430824),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 432853),
          text: '"So that\'s everything?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 432853),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 434047),
          text: 'Dadi smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 434047),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 436673),
          text: '"That is only the beginning."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 436673),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 441375),
          text:
              'She reached behind the wooden box and placed a narrow case on the table.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 441862),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 442921),
          text: 'Akhlaq immediately opened it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 442921),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 446421),
          text: 'Inside lay a single pen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 448421),
          text: 'Imaan looked puzzled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 448421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 450421),
          text: '"A pen?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 450421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 453850),
          text: 'At the bottom of the case was one name:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 453850),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 454421),
          text: 'IDRIS',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 454421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 455941),
          text: 'The children looked at Dadi.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 456421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 459421),
          text: '"What does a pen have to do with a Prophet?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 460512),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 461421),
          text: 'Akhlaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 462141),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 464372),
          text: 'Dadi gently closed the case.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 464372),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 467223),
          text: '"That," she said, "is another story."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 467223),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 474969),
          text:
              'And with that, the story of the first human family ended - while the story of humanity continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 474969),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 482857),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Celebrate, Don\'t Compete',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 482857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 492737),
          text:
              'Today, when someone receives something good that you also wanted - a good mark, praise, a turn, a role, a prize or attention - do one sincere act of kindness toward them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 492737),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 498097),
          text:
              'Congratulate them, encourage them, help them, or celebrate their success.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 498097),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 501857),
          text: 'Do not add a comparison about yourself afterward.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 501857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 510385),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Choose someone you regularly compete with and make your sincere act of kindness toward that person specifically.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 510385),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 513465),
          text: 'End of the Hazrat Adam (A.S.) Series',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 513465),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 517145),
          text: 'Next: Hazrat Idris (A.S.) - The Prophet of Truth',
        ),
      ],
    ),
  ],
);
